                <pb facs="0567" n="493" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg493"/>

                <head>No. 8.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center"
                            >[Telegram.—Translation.—<placeName>Ferrol</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1865-02-15">February 15</date>—9 o’clock a.
                        m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">To the Chargé d’Affaires of the United States,
                        Madrid:</hi></p>
                <p>The Niagara is in this port. The Stonewall, it is now said, will be ready to-day
                    in her works, I received your telegram; am advised all right.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>FERNANDEZ.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
